      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are seeing yourself only in terms of the problems you cause, which is a very painful way to view yourself. But please understand that your life has value beyond the things that require cleanup or effort from others. The idea that stopping would be a gift to her is a dangerous conclusion to draw; your absence would create a different, profound kind of loss. It is time to look for ways to ease the situation that don't involve you disappearing.",
